WEBVTT

00:00:00.070 --> 00:00:02.117
The CEO walks onstage at nine.

00:00:02.520 --> 00:00:04.292
Breakfast is still being served.

00:00:04.690 --> 00:00:07.534
Who decides when to close the doors
and cue the microphone?

00:00:07.794 --> 00:00:10.473
We settle those questions
before your guests arrive.

00:00:10.876 --> 00:00:13.678
We translate your business
goal into a program,

00:00:14.063 --> 00:00:17.181
assign decision makers,
and rehearse the handoffs.

00:00:17.440 --> 00:00:20.599
We select and coordinate catering, décor,

00:00:20.902 --> 00:00:23.978
multimedia, staffing
and logistics partners.

00:00:24.382 --> 00:00:26.621
The caterer knows when service pauses.

00:00:27.019 --> 00:00:30.165
The audio lead knows exactly
when the speaker steps up.

00:00:30.425 --> 00:00:33.914
That experience comes
from more than two hundred and fifty small

00:00:33.928 --> 00:00:37.348
and midsize events,
alongside our corporate productions.

00:00:37.608 --> 00:00:41.083
When you hire VNV for full
corporate event production,

00:00:41.289 --> 00:00:42.924
the digital system is included.

00:00:43.327 --> 00:00:47.132
Registration, check-in
and crew assignments share one plan.

00:00:47.531 --> 00:00:49.660
You can keep using it for future events.

00:00:49.920 --> 00:00:52.489
From the first arrival
to the last presentation,

00:00:52.695 --> 00:00:54.508
your team knows who is calling the show.

00:00:54.911 --> 00:00:57.288
Tell us what your next
event needs to accomplish.
